## Acceptance criteria

- No opaque title backing or focus ring paints over the spiral.
-34pxtitle,28pxcaptions and four photos remain; no text shrinking or hidden overflow.
- Native Tab/Back focus, failure/reduced-motion/static modes and top-hinge motion work.
